rce location or observed payload.\n- The determination of whether a reliable pre-start vs. runtime distinction is possible is recorded and communicated, with the impact on the failure-state UI stated explicitly.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- Gates the P2 requirement for pre-start vs. runtime failure distinction: the answer determines whether that feature is implemented or the single-\"Failed\"-state fallback is used.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":54344,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-92f56919d3942a78","agent_id":"af27bab92b4583410","session_id":"4d1cfcd2-7a48-4a97-8f21-5ac7a29e76ba","uuid":"56791490-652f-494a-b38d-8133d23fcae0","timestamp":"2026-10-22T10:33:13.904Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8005"}
