r absent codes fall back to the single \"Failed\" rendering with `status.message` text as supplementary detail.\n- Visual treatments match the approved UX specification.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- Covers the P2 requirement for pre-start vs. runtime failure distinction using `status.message.message_code`.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":58053,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-92f56919d3942a78","agent_id":"af27bab92b4583410","session_id":"4d1cfcd2-7a48-4a97-8f21-5ac7a29e76ba","uuid":"4137e42b-bf62-46f9-8058-cb4a0b708498","timestamp":"2026-10-22T10:34:11.003Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8005"}
