{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-81370092da2053ca","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8005-E003\n3\ttitle: UX specification for evaluation job state and progress indicators\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8005\n5\tcomponent: UXD\n6\tteam: UX/Design\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tai_signals:\n10\t  change_specificity: 1\n11\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n12\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n13\t  existing_foundation: 1\n14\t  open_questions: 1\n15\t  external_dependency: 0\n16\t  human_process_gates: -1\n17\t  repo_access: 0\n18\t  architecture_claims: 1\n19\timplementation_type: null\n20\tdependencies: []\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 4\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# UX Specification for Evaluation Job State and Progress Indicators\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tProduce the UX/design specification for evaluation job state visuals and progress indicators on the EvalHub Evaluations landing page, fulfilling the \"progress indicator UX specification\" design doc listed as to-be-created in the strategy. The specification covers state icon/color/label treatments, the benchmark progress and elapsed time display pattern, the non-blocking warning pattern for temporarily unavailable status updates, and the visual treatment distinguishing pre-start failures from runtime failures. It is PatternFly-aligned and is the artifact the job-table UI implementation builds against.\n34\t\n35\t## Scope\n36\t\n37\t- State icon, color, and label specifications for queued/pending, running, failed, and completed job states, derived from the list endpoint's `status.state` field, using PatternFly status components (Label, Icon).\n38\t- Visual treatment specification for the potential \"Failed (not started)\" pre-start failure distinction, distinct from the runtime \"Failed\" state.\n39\t- Progress indicator pattern for benchmark-level progress (\"Benchmarks: X/N complete\") including the single-benchmark case, where elapsed time acts as the primary progress indicator.\n40\t- Elapsed time display pattern (e.g., \"Elapsed: 4m 12s\").\n41\t- Non-blocking inline warning pattern (PatternFly Alert, warning variant) shown while status updates are temporarily unavailable, with last successful data still displayed.\n42\t- Progress indicator pattern review and PatternFly alignment check with the ODH Dashboard implementation team.\n43\t\n44\t## Acceptance Criteria\n45\t\n46\t- The specification defines distinct icon, color, and label for each of queued/pending, running, failed, and completed states, visually distinguishable from one another per the PatternFly status pattern.\n47\t- The specification defines the benchmark progress display, elapsed time display, and the warning banner pattern, including behavior when only top-level state is available (before the first detail fetch returns).\n48\t- The specification is reviewed and approved by UX/Design and the ODH Dashboard team.\n49\t\n50\t## HLR Traceability\n51\t\n52\t- Enables the P0 requirement for visual distinction between queued/pending, running, failed, and completed states.\n53\t- Informs the visual design of the P1 benchmark-level progress display, P1 elapsed time display, and P2 pre-start vs. runtime failure distinction.\n54\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-99aea0eeced0803c","agent_id":"a658e2710e15ff1a2","session_id":"4d1cfcd2-7a48-4a97-8f21-5ac7a29e76ba","uuid":"bbf07fff-c738-4686-9eee-33906ee3c335","timestamp":"2026-10-22T10:52:42.009Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-81370092da2053ca","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8005 decomposition"}
